    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Little Perspective is a grid-based puzzle game with unique twists revolving around line-of-sight, object permanence, and spatial awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate the camera to change your perspective - create new pathways, sidestep obstructions, and exploit impossible physics to solve the game's many non-euclidean challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485300/extras/19570eef1575f71ab72e1562023d1eab.poster.avif?t=1748097291\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485300/extras/19570eef1575f71ab72e1562023d1eab.webm?t=1748097291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485300/extras/19570eef1575f71ab72e1562023d1eab.mp4?t=1748097291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is all about challenging your preconceptions, thinking outside the box, making surprising discoveries, and ultimately seeing what you couldn't see before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485300/extras/369b052bc9dbc7eba65b78733369d84a.poster.avif?t=1748097291\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485300/extras/369b052bc9dbc7eba65b78733369d84a.webm?t=1748097291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485300/extras/369b052bc9dbc7eba65b78733369d84a.mp4?t=1748097291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ puzzles built around the game's mind-bending properties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An open hub that gives you freedom to choose how you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A compelling narrative that unfolds as you progress deeper into the game, with twists and turns as you gain new insights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple control schemes - customizable keyboard and gamepad controls, and fully playable with just a mouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-class Steam Deck support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485300/extras/347b92abf77db2650466a38092911edc.poster.avif?t=1748097291\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485300/extras/347b92abf77db2650466a38092911edc.webm?t=1748097291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485300/extras/347b92abf77db2650466a38092911edc.mp4?t=1748097291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Little Perspective is a grid-based puzzle game with unique twists revolving around line-of-sight, object permanence, and spatial awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate the camera to change your perspective - create new pathways, sidestep obstructions, and exploit impossible physics to solve the game's many non-euclidean challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485300/extras/19570eef1575f71ab72e1562023d1eab.poster.avif?t=1748097291\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485300/extras/19570eef1575f71ab72e1562023d1eab.webm?t=1748097291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485300/extras/19570eef1575f71ab72e1562023d1eab.mp4?t=1748097291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is all about challenging your preconceptions, thinking outside the box, making surprising discoveries, and ultimately seeing what you couldn't see before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485300/extras/369b052bc9dbc7eba65b78733369d84a.poster.avif?t=1748097291\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485300/extras/369b052bc9dbc7eba65b78733369d84a.webm?t=1748097291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485300/extras/369b052bc9dbc7eba65b78733369d84a.mp4?t=1748097291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ puzzles built around the game's mind-bending properties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An open hub that gives you freedom to choose how you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A compelling narrative that unfolds as you progress deeper into the game, with twists and turns as you gain new insights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple control schemes - customizable keyboard and gamepad controls, and fully playable with just a mouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-class Steam Deck support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485300/extras/347b92abf77db2650466a38092911edc.poster.avif?t=1748097291\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485300/extras/347b92abf77db2650466a38092911edc.webm?t=1748097291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485300/extras/347b92abf77db2650466a38092911edc.mp4?t=1748097291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
